    "summary_insights": [
      "Revenue has demonstrated exceptional growth, increasing by 220% from 2023 to 2025, with further projected growth in 2026.",
      "Gross margin experienced a significant compression from 56.7% in 2023 to 43.1% in 2024, before stabilising around 47% in subsequent years.",
      "Net profit margin has expanded dramatically from 4.8% in 2023 to over 21% in 2025 and 2026, indicating strong operational gearing.",
      "Interest coverage is exceptionally robust at 134x in 2025, suggesting very low financial risk and high resilience.",
      "The business has successfully scaled its overheads, with administrative expenses growing at a much slower rate than revenue.",
      "Profitability improvements are driven by increased job throughput and higher average project values through established management systems.",
      "The transition from a loss-making Adjusted EBITDA in 2023 to a 21% margin in 2025 highlights a successful business turnaround and scaling phase."
    ]
