    "summary_insights": [
      "The company demonstrates exceptional growth in shareholder value, with net assets increasing by 230% from 2023 to 2026 (projected).",
      "Liquidity remains robust and healthy, with the current ratio consistently above 1.7 and projected to reach 2.59 by 2026.",
      "Cash reserves have seen a significant upward trend, growing from £132,907 in 2023 to a projected £590,308 in 2026, supporting operational scalability.",
      "The capital structure is conservative, with the gearing ratio decreasing sharply from 18.1% in 2023 to a projected 1.9% in 2026 as long-term debt is cleared.",
      "Net current assets (working capital) have expanded significantly, rising from £169,975 in 2023 to a projected £633,338 in 2026, indicating strong short-term financial resilience.",
      "The balance sheet reflects a transition towards a more asset-light model, with tangible fixed assets decreasing while cash and receivables drive the growth in total assets."
